# ─── SxSHADOW PoC / forge artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────
# `output/` is a Python package (output/__init__.py, output/*.py) AND the
# default --out directory for forged proxies, packaged binaries, scan reports,
# build artifacts, etc. Track only the .py source; ignore everything else.
output/*/
output/*.json
output/*.html
output/*.csv
output/*.yml
output/*.yaml

# Compiled proxy DLLs / build leftovers
*.dll
*.exe
*.lib
*.exp
*.obj
*.o
*.pdb
*.ilk

